<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading 22,000 T flour in Rouen.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading 22,000 T flour in Rouen.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are loading a combined 22,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour is for export to Cuba, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
